      "id": "reflection_0",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_0_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "They were SPARED?! I walked all that way and now everyone just... gets to be fine?!",
          "speaker": "jonah",
          "align": "left",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "shake",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "align": "right",
      "svg": "Act4_02_Jonah_stomped_off_sat_under_a_fig_tree",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Jonah stays grumpy",
          "note": "Jonah crosses his arms. He is, in fact, extremely grumpy."
        },
        {
          "label": "Jonah kicks a pebble",
          "note": "Jonah kicks a pebble into the dirt. Still grumpy."
        }
      ],
      "id": "reflection_1",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_1_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Jonah stomped off outside the city, sat under a leafy fig tree, and sulked in its shade.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "right",
          "position": "middle-right",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act4_03_worm_nibbled_the_roots_and_the_plant_withered",
      "id": "reflection_2",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_2_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Overnight, a worm nibbled the roots, and the plant withered away completely.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jonah",
      "fx": "type",
      "svg": "Act4_04_My_favorite_tree_Gone",
      "id": "reflection_3",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_3_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "My favorite tree! Gone! Why does everything I care about disappear?!",
          "speaker": "jonah",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "type",
          "delay": 800
        },
        {
          "id": "reflection_3_sfx",
          "type": "sfx",
          "sfx": true,
          "text": "ARGH!",
          "position": "top-middle",
          "style": "sfx-impact",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act4_05_Youre_upset_about_one_small_plant",
      "id": "reflection_4",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_4_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "You're upset about one small plant that you didn't even plant yourself.",
          "speaker": "god",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act4_06_care_about_a_whole_city_full_of_people",
      "id": "reflection_5",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_5_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "So why is it so hard to believe I'd care about a whole city full of people — even ones who made mistakes?",
          "speaker": "god",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jonah",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act4_05_Youre_upset_about_one_small_plant",
      "id": "reflection_6",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_6_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "...I guess I wanted them to get in trouble. But I got a second chance too. Out of a fish, of all places.",
          "speaker": "jonah",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "type",
      "svg": "Act4_07_everyone_stumbles_sometimes",
      "id": "reflection_7",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_7_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "And Jonah sat in the quiet, and understood — everyone stumbles sometimes. Everyone deserves a way back.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "type",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act4_08_THE_END",
      "id": "reflection_8",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "reflection_8_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "THE END",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
